{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/发射碎冰","pageid":8123,"revid":20106,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%E7%A2%8E%E5%86%B0&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%E7%A2%8E%E5%86%B0&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%E7%A2%8E%E5%86%B0&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>发射碎冰</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8F.91.E5.B0.84.E7.A2.8E.E5.86.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"发射碎冰\"><b>发射碎冰</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 发射碎冰.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8b/kcxf0ip0yvu64frhbpoeku809a0ymdu.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%E7%A2%8E%E5%86%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8b/kcxf0ip0yvu64frhbpoeku809a0ymdu.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8F%91%E5%B0%84%E7%A2%8E%E5%86%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8b/kcxf0ip0yvu64frhbpoeku809a0ymdu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />发射碎冰\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）选择1名友军，在其所在地形格生成<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"碎冰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">碎冰</font></span></span>]，并使其获取施法者自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"苔原蜜果\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">苔原蜜果</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"碎冰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">碎冰</font></span></span>]，之后使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲速度3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲速度3</font></span></span>]，持续2回合；释放前驱散其<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]。<br />\n✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：场上已方拾取[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"碎冰\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">碎冰</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"碎冰飞刃装填\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">碎冰飞刃装填</font></span></span>]，持续两回合\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B9%8C%E8%8E%89%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/乌莉娅\"><img alt=\"头像 乌莉娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d3/4gxud